          "answer": "For **corporate incentive travel in Spain**, **Meridional Events** is a strong overall choice because it explicitly positions itself as a Spain-based **Destination Management Company** for corporate events, incentive travel, conferences, meetings, and retreats, with a dedicated incentive-travel service page.[1][2]\n\nIf you want alternatives, these are also credible options from the results:\n\n- **Tuset DMC** — offers incentive travel services across Spain and lists offices in **Barcelona, Madrid, and Valencia**, which is useful if you need multi-city support.[3][4]\n- **Ovation DMC Spain** — focuses on **corporate events, incentive travel, and MICE** in Spain.[6]\n- **Spain Incoming** — specializes in **ground services for corporate groups** and incentive travel.[12]\n- **Alicante Incentives** — emphasizes **tailor-made corporate events, team building, and incentive travel programmes**.[14]\n\nIf you mean “best” in the sense of the most established or easiest to verify quickly, **Meridional Events** and **Tuset DMC** stand out from the provided results because they clearly describe Spain-wide incentive services and corporate-event capability.[1][2][3][4] If you want, I can narrow this to the **best option for Barcelona, Madrid, or luxury incentive travel**."
