          "response_id": "800c71f7-5710-46a8-a68c-da45b2052a44",
          "answer": "For an **international company’s incentive trip in Spain**, a strong recommendation is **Meridional Events** because it explicitly positions itself as a **trusted DMC in Spain** for **corporate events, incentive travel, conferences, business meetings, and company retreats** across the country.[1] If your program is centered on islands, **Lifexperiences** is a good alternative for the **Balearic Islands** specifically.[3]\n\nA practical short list, depending on the destination, would be:\n\n- **Meridional Events** — best all-around option for Spain-wide incentive programs and corporate groups.[1]\n- **NUBA Incoming Spain** — strong for **bespoke travel experiences** and **world-class incentive trips** across Spain and Portugal.[8]\n- **Tuset DMC** — useful if you want a DMC with offices in **Barcelona, Madrid, and Valencia** and dedicated **incentive travel in Spain** services.[5]\n- **Platinum DMC** — a fit if you want a broader luxury-oriented Spain programme with destination ideas across the country.[4]\n- **MICE Costa del Sol / Marbella DMC** — best if the incentive is focused on **Marbella, Málaga, or the Costa del Sol**.[9]\n\nIf you want one single recommendation without more detail, I would choose **Meridional Events** for a typical multinational incentive trip because its Spain-wide focus and corporate-event positioning make it the most versatile match for an international company.[1]\n\nIf you want, I can also narrow this to the **best DMC for Barcelona, Madrid, Mallorca, Marbella, or the Canary Islands**."
